# Semgrep ignore list.
#
# NOTE: the presence of this file REPLACES Semgrep's built-in defaults
# entirely -- it does not extend them. The "restored defaults" block below
# must stay, or test/ and minified JS come back into every scan.

# ---- Restored Semgrep defaults ----
# Common large / vendored paths
node_modules/
build/
dist/
vendor/
.env/
.venv/
.tox/
.npm/
.yarn/
*.min.js

# Common test paths
test/
tests/
*_test.go

# Semgrep's own artifacts
.semgrep
.semgrep_logs/

# ---- CrossPoint Reader additions ----
# Vendored upstream NimBLE: ~460 of 1188 targets and the source of every
# github-actions-mutable-action-tag / memset-removal / sizeof-pointer-type
# finding. We do not patch it and its workflows never run from this repo.
lib/NimBLE-Arduino/

# PlatformIO build output and generated headers (see CLAUDE.md).
.pio/
*.generated.h
